ood's Friday closes (weeks ending 9 Oct to 20 Nov: -2.0, -6.6, -1.5, -3.0, -8.8, -12.8, -22.9%). TNW, citing CNBC: 'its seventh straight weekly decline, the longest weekly losing streak since 2008'."}, "story_sources": {"BRBR": "Motley Fool, 'Why BellRing Brands Stock Surged Today' (Joe Tenebruso, 18 Nov 2026 8:52 PM EST): 'jumped 24% on Wednesday' after it 'issued an upbeat earnings forecast for the year ahead'; net sales +7% to $692 million; fiscal 2027 EBITDA forecast $310-350 million against $289 million. Earnings Whispers via Finviz (18 Nov 2026): revenue $692.0 million against a $653.16 million estimate; adjusted EPS $0.22 against $0.21; new CEO Michael Axelrod 'pivoting from chasing volume to rebuilding margins'. No source read explains Thursday's further +10.6%.", "NVDA": "TNW, 'SEC examines Nvidia's accounting as its stock suffers worst run since 2008' (Cristian Dina, 21 Nov 2026 2:00 pm GMT), relaying Reuters, the NYT, the WSJ and CNBC; The Coin Republic (21 Nov 2026): 'closed Friday at $125.53, down 14.01%'; Breitbart (20 Nov 2026) relaying the same report; InvestmentNews (17 Nov 2026) on the WSJ's Tuesday report of an SEC civil probe; AP via The Business Journal (18 Nov 2026): results beat estimates and the stock finished down 2.9% on Wednesday.", "MSTR": "Stocktwits (Anushka Basu, updated 20 Nov 2026 11:28 PM EST): 'Bitcoin (BTC) fell below $60,000 Friday for the first time since July'; 850,849 BTC at an average cost of $75,452; 'a new 52-week low'. The Coin Republic (Glory Kaburu, 21 Nov 2026 8:31 am EST): 'MSTR stock dropped 9.67% on Friday, Nov. 20, closing at $77.80'.", "TU": "The Canadian Press via BNN Bloomberg (16 Nov 2026) and via Castanet: C$6.35 cash plus 0.17 Québecor Class B share, about C$31 billion, Telus CEO Victor Dodig's 'serious concerns'. StockTitan (16 Nov 2026): terms, non-binding, 13 Nov close US$8.53. InvestorsHub via Finviz (16 Nov 2026): the board's special committee. Insider Monkey via Yahoo Finance (Angelica Ballesteros, 19 No